tes. However, the underlying hash algorithm is designed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to exhibit avalanche effects: slight changes to the seed or the input byte"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence will typically produce drastic changes in the generated hash value."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not save or otherwise reuse hash values across executions of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"program. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hasher"},{"type":"text","text":" is usually randomly seeded, which means it will return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"different values on every new execution of your program. The hash"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithm implemented by "},{"code":"Hasher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" may itself change between any two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"versions of the standard library.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Hasher","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Sendable":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/sendable","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Sendable","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A thread-safe type whose values can be shared across arbitrary isolation","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"domains without introducing a risk of data races."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Sendable","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Sendable"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Hasher/combine(bytes:)-2ctj6":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds the contents of the given buffer to this hasher, mixing it